    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d270">

                <pb facs="0717" n="631" sameAs="frus:frus1873p1v1/pg631"/>

                <head>No. 267.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. <persName type="from"
                            >Nelson</persName> to Mr. <persName corresp="#p_HF1" type="to"
                            >Fish</persName>.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1872-09-20"><hi rendition="#italic">September</hi> 20,
                        1872</date>. (Received October 17.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 640.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Herewith I inclose the speeches pronounced
                    by President Lerdo de Tejada, (A and B,) and by General Pedro Baranda, president
                    of the Mexican Congress, (C and D),) on the 16th instant, on the occasion of the
                    opening of the sessions of that body.</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><persName>THOMAS H. NELSON</persName>.</signed>
                </closer>



                <xi:include href="d270-a1.xml" xpointer="d270-a1"/>
                <xi:include href="d270-a2.xml" xpointer="d270-a2"/>
